  lines:
  - avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8293de3f1bb94bf4baf3a7d5cd3aff72, type: 3}
    content: (Nervously) I... I think this batch came out right! Please try it, Kaguya.
  - avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a472bed8c925d54c88c9848f2e0dd82, type: 3}
    content: (eyes sparkle) Mmm! Iroha!
  - avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a472bed8c925d54c88c9848f2e0dd82, type: 3}
    content: They're absolutely perfect! Fluffy, sweet, and melt-in-your-mouth delicious!
  - avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8293de3f1bb94bf4baf3a7d5cd3aff72, type: 3}
    content: Really?! Oh, I'm so happy!
  - avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a472bed8c925d54c88c9848f2e0dd82, type: 3}
    content: See? I knew you could do it. You're the best, Iroha!
  - avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a472bed8c925d54c88c9848f2e0dd82, type: 3}
    content: Now... could you make another stack?
